        "en": "Knowledgeable and compassionate store staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers consistently praise the boutique staff for their exceptional product knowledge and genuine dedication to animal wellness. Reviewers highlight team members who take time to troubleshoot health issues, offering helpful advice on dietary allergies and senior pet care. Aside from one return dispute, shoppers describe the team as remarkably kind."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Curated selection of Canadian goods"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers appreciate the bright, clean store aesthetic and extensive inventory of premium natural pet products. Pet parents highlight hard-to-find items such as Carna4 food, therapeutic CBD oils, and holistic joint supplements that support ailing pets. Reviewers also value convenient storefront parking and an easy-to-navigate website for online ordering."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt delivery and helpful communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the store's efficient local delivery service and swift online order dispatch. Reviewers note that couriers communicate attentively, even calling customers directly when building buzzers fail or bringing heavy cat food bags right to apartment doors. Pet owners value the thoughtful service and complimentary treat samples."
      }
    }
  ],
